  "details": "Okay look, maybe instead of looking at how the mb's slooooowly going up, you just see a \"teleporting\" animation? Like, come-on. That's a type of a Metaverse after all. There should be something better when you're changing a world. And, would be twice better if in the loading screen you could ALSO use your menu to configure or check something while loading. But, please rethink my idea, and make something similar. It would perfectly fit VRChat's design and idea. And if you didn't understand my idea, then there is a world that has a very similar concept to what I'm thinking about. Name: HoloDome Udon. Author: GoldenMass. I mostly got inspired by the \"dying animation loading\" in a game named Borderlands:",
